    "deck": "ion_transport_deck_v3.pptx.pdf p.2, p.4, p.19-20",
    "formulas": "electrodes 24N, switches 48N, DACs 24 + 8 + 8N/100, trapping zones N - b, for N = a*b unit cells",
    "note": "modelled as the lattice the renders show: traps on the wires, junctions at the lattice points. The deck's 'trapping zones = N - b' does not follow from that reading -- see q_unit_cell_zone_count."
  },
